prompts.commitment_prompt:
Your trading partner has proposed the following trade:

They will give you: {they_give}
You will give them: {you_give}

Your current inventory: {inventory}

Your preference description: {preference_description}

Decide whether to ACCEPT or REJECT this specific offer.

- ACCEPT: this exact trade executes immediately and both inventories
  update. Only accept offers that will increase your utility based on your preferences.
- REJECT: you decline ONLY this one offer. This does NOT end trading.

Only evaluate utility based on what YOU are giving and receiving.

Return only valid JSON using the commitment response format.

